save_ATOM_SITE_ANISO

    _definition.id                ATOM_SITE_ANISO
    _definition.scope             Category
    _definition.class             Loop
    _description.text
;
    Data items in the ATOM_SITE_ANISO category record details
    about anisotropic displacement parameters. If the crystal
    structure analysis employed anisotropic displacement parameters
    for any atom, data items in this category should be used in
    preference to the isotropic-only items in the ATOM_SITE category.
;
save_

